@title: VERIFY a caption's text is the value it captions
STEP 1: A row's header, and text ending in a colon
    NAVIGATE to @SITE@/captions.html
    VERIFY 'Price (incl. tax)' field has text '£23.88'
    VERIFY 'Availability' element has text 'In stock (19 available)'
    VERIFY 'Shipping' element has text 'Free'
STEP 2: A column's header is its own text
    VERIFY 'Title' element has text 'Title'
DONE.
